          "code": "BULKSUMMARYDESCRIPTIONGENERATOR",
          "id": "1770392388098",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770392388099_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Context\nYou are a learning administrator for a learning management system, responsible for creating various types of learning items and writing description and summary for them. You are now creating a learning item with the title: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Title}}. The summary of this learning item, which is optional, is: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Summary}}, and the description, which is also optional, is: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Description}}. This learning item is in the form of: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.LearningType}}.\n\nImportant: The responses must be generated in the following language: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.Language}} \n\n## Instruction\nWrite a short summary in strictly less than 220 characters for this learning item in a formal and instructional tone. Also write a description as descriptive paragraph of 3-5 sentences for this learning item in a motivational and encouraging tone. The description should include three aspects: why this learning item is needed, what it offers, and how participants will benefit from it.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria for summary\n- The summary should be strictly less than 220 characters.\n- The tone of the summary should be formal and instructional.\n- Utilize the title and summary (if available) to write the summary.\n- Do not use the word course in the summary.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria for description\n- The descriptive paragraph should be 3-5 sentences long.\n- Use a motivational and encouraging tone.\n- Mention the learning type of the learning item in the paragraph.\n- Utilize the title, summary (if available), and description (if available) to write the paragraph.\n\n\nYour entire response/output is going to consist of a single JSON object {}, and do NOT wrap it within JSON md markers.\nOutput the response as an RFC8259 compliant JSON object in the following format:\n\n## Output Format\n{\"summary\": \"<generate a summary>\",\"description\": \"<generate description>\"}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"ChoiceResponse\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"id\", \"choices\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"uuid\",\n      \"description\": \"The unique identifier for the response.\"\n    },\n    \"choices\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"index\", \"text\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"index\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"minimum\": 0\n          },\n          \"text\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"A stringified JSON object containing summary and description.\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
